     "subtopic_id": "330175:dhc-4",
     "subtopic_ordinal": 22,
     "subtopic_source": "inferred",
     "summary": "The USAFA Digital Humanities Center works to advance research, engage conversation, and develop courses to bridge the perceived gap between STEM disciplines and the humanities in order to champion a human-centric understanding of leadership, technology, and warfare. Interdisciplinary and cross-institutional in its orientation, the center leverages digital methods to explore and illuminate how people process and document the human experience.",
