     "subtopic_ordinal": 24,
     "subtopic_source": "inferred",
     "summary": "The Nuclear Enterprise Research Center (NERC) performs research on topics in support of DTRA, AFTAC, AFNWC and other government sponsors. Example topics include radiation transport, radioisotope transport in the atmosphere, nuclear debris characterization, radiation detection, etc. Topics are geared to answer the unique questions or problems of our sponsors while also providing our undergraduates with a rich, relevant research experience. The Center collaborates with other USAFA research centers making use of their extensive experimental facilities.",
