     "subtopic_ordinal": 1,
     "subtopic_source": "inferred",
     "summary": "The Joint Force operates in areas of the world where endemic and emerging infectious diseases present substantial and immediate health risks to U.S. personnel. Future operational scenarios, to include large scale combat operations (LSCOs), pose an increased risk of infectious diseases due to degraded natural environmental disease barriers and public health infrastructure, as well as the potential for delayed evacuation times.",
