     "summary": "Topics of interest within Atomic and Molecular Physics (AMP) include: Quantum degenerate atomic gases, both Bose and Fermi, their excitations and properties, including mixed species, mixed state, and molecular; Quantum enhanced precision metrology; Nonlinear processes; Quantum systems in cavities; Collective and many-body states of matter; and Emerging areas. There is an interest in emerging areas of AMO physics such as collective states of matter, emergent lattices in quantum gases, non-equilibrium many body dynamics, advanced quantum simulation, and metrology in non-ideal environments.",
