     "summary": "The objective of the Multi-Agent Network Control program is to establish the physical, mathematical and information processing foundations for the control of complex dynamic networks with possibly multiple controllers that may operate using different information sets. The research program seeks the development of novel mathematical and computational methods for the modeling and control of the collective behavior of large-scale networked systems controlled by of heterogeneous agents which may or may not follow a common goal.",
