     "summary": "ARL seeks to develop antenna apertures (i.e., antennas and antenna arrays) for future Army systems. To realize these radiating structures, there is interest in utilizing new man-made, or engineered materials, as well as novel processes such as additive manufacturing. Future platforms will require apertures that are low in profile and can be integrated into both ground and airborne platforms and are conformal to such platforms. Such apertures should have little or no visible signature as well as minimal or no obvious protrusion.",
