     "summary": "Support planning and implementation of the annual U.S. Space Forum as the flagship convening event for Project Constellation. [Note: Planning for the 2026 Forum on October 15-16, 2026, is already underway and can serve as the venue to announce Project Constellation. Planning for the 2027-2028 Forums would be part of this award. The use of UN venue space in Vienna is free of charge, but other costs may be incurred. Illustrative activities may include: • Program design and logistical support. • Speaker and stakeholder engagement.",
